  discarded, only alpha survives — so this is one solid shape rather than a
  shrunken product logo, which would have arrived as a grey blob.

  A circle with a mark through it: the closest the mark can get to Quiet's own
  glyph while staying legible at 24dp in a monochrome status bar.
-->
